{
  "hash": 555281244,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Direct Weapon Hits grant a stack of Precision Instrument for 1 second (2 seconds on Bows and Linear Fusion Rifles).\n\nMaximum of 6 stacks. Missing removes all stacks... usually.\n\nHeavy Burst Frame weapons can only gain 1 stack per burst.\n\nAdaptive Burst Linear Fusion Rifles require 2 Hits for each stack (and missing sometimes does not remove your stacks on them).\n\nPrecision damage increase at 1|2|...6 stacks:\n<enhanced/>${4.17*#d}% | ${8.33*#d}% | ${12.5*#d}% | ${16.67*#d}% | ${20.83*#d}% | ${25*#d}%\n#note\n\nThe damage increase also applies to Weakspot damage (technically distinct from Precision damage and includes cases like landing Precision Hits on shielded PvE Combatants)\n\nvar note = (More precisely: <enhanced/>${25*#d}% / 6 × [stacks])\nenhanced (\nvar d = 1.2\nvar note = empty\n<enhanced/> Precision Damage Buff is increased by 20%.\n)",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-26T12:13:52.078Z",
      "updatedBy": "StardustD2",
