    "rowKey": "Precision Instrument",
    "section": "Weapon Traits",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Upon scoring a Direct Weapon Hit:\nGrants a stack of Precision Instrument, up to a maximum of 6 stacks for 1 seconds. Lasts 2 seconds on Bows and Linear Fusion Rifles.\nAdditional Direct Weapon Hits refresh the buff duration. All stacks are removed upon missing.\nBuff persists through stow.\n\nAdaptive Burst Linear Fusion Rifle exclusive: Requires 2 hits per stack. All stacks are removed upon missing, except when it doesn't :)\nHeavy Burst Frame exclusive: Can only get 1 stack per burst.\n\n4.17% | 8.34% | 12.5% | 16.7% | 20.83% | 25% Increased Precision Damage.\n↑5% | 10% | 15% | 20% | 25% | 30% Increased Precision Damage.\nAlso increases Weakspot Damage (Precision Hits against Shielded Combatants)",
